            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "`(quote (lambda …))` is a list whose first element is the symbol `lambda`. Under `lexical-binding: t` it captures nothing, so any variable its body reads from the enclosing scope is unbound when it runs — and the byte compiler cannot compile it."
